This product is derived from ort-server (https://github.com/lemonade-sdk/ort-server),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The /classify contract, manifest
handling, tokenizer handling and model-family allowlist in src/text_model.cpp come from
ort-server's src/main.cpp; the inference engine was changed from ONNX Runtime to
LiteRT. tools/export_tflite.py follows the export.py shipped in the lemonade-sdk
*-ONNX classifier repositories.

It links:
- LiteRT (https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT), Apache License 2.0
- HuggingFace tokenizers via mlc-ai/tokenizers-cpp, Apache License 2.0
- cpp-httplib, MIT License
- nlohmann/json, MIT License
- stb_image v2.30 (https://github.com/nothings/stb, commit 013ac3b), public domain or MIT
  License, vendored unmodified in third_party/stb (see third_party/stb/README)
